        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Regular participles: **-ado**, **-ido**. The participle never changes."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Habría** has an accent on the **í** in every person."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Uses: _would have done_ (**habría llamado**), the result of an impossible past condition (**si hubiera sabido, habría venido**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In Mexico, **hubiera** + participle is very common in the result clause too: **yo hubiera llamado**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: conditional of **haber** + **-ado / -ido**."
        }
      ]
